OL,3,GNEWSAGender-critical equality officer  
OL,4,Aunfairly sacked by council             
OL,6,FAn equality and diversity manager was  
OL,7,Funfairly sacked after a "Kafkaesque"   
OL,8,Finvestigation into her liking or       
OL,9,Fcommenting on posts critical of        
OL,10,Ftransgender ideology, a judge has      
OL,11,Fruled.                                 
OL,13,FLorna Young was dismissed by Manchester
OL,14,FCity Council in 2024 after a staff     
OL,15,Fmember found an account on X linked to 
OL,16,Fher which included posts critical of   
OL,17,Ftrans themes and a comment that a      
OL,18,Fnon-binary vicar had been guided by    
OL,19,F"the devil".                           
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
