OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGender-critical equality officer  
OL,4,Aunfairly sacked by council             
OL,6,FAn employment tribunal heard that      
OL,7,FYoung, a devout Catholic in her 50s,   
OL,8,Fwas at the time under investigation    
OL,9,Ffollowing complaints from some of her  
OL,10,Fteam after she had asked them to       
OL,11,Fresearch gender recognition            
OL,12,Fperspectives while producing a report  
OL,13,Ffor the authority.                     
OL,15,FThe investigation into those initial   
OL,16,Fcomplaints expanded when one of the    
OL,17,Femployees discovered another account   
OL,18,FYoung ran under the name Galway Girl,  
OL,19,Fand the council eventually dismissed   
OL,20,Fher on the basis of that account's     
OL,21,Factivity.                              
